 Slot position Bins are generated by `scripts/make_bin.py`, whose constants were reverse-engineered from a
 Slot position [gridfinitygenerator.com](https://gridfinitygenerator.com) bin so they interlock with bins printed
 Slot position from that tool: footprint `42n - 0.62` (corner r 3.75), base pad `35.48 r0.8` chamfered 45 deg to
 Slot position `41.38 r3.75` over 4.75 mm, 1.2 mm walls, and a stacking lip mirroring the base profile.
 Slot position The outer profile matches that reference exactly at every height. Solid pads, no magnet or screw holes.
 Slot position 2.15 chamfer), solid pads with no magnet or screw holes, and a stacking lip.
