 Slot position ## Accuracy
 Slot position 
 Slot position Outlines are traced from photographs and scaled to two hand measurements per tool
 Slot position (overall length and maximum width). They are **not** derived from manufacturer drawings.
 Slot position Expect them to be right to about a millimetre — good enough for a pocket with 1.5 mm of
 Slot position clearance, not good enough for a press fit. Each tool's README records the measurements
 Slot position used, so anything that looks wrong can be traced back.
 Slot position 
 Slot position The generator cross-checks the traced aspect ratio against the two measurements and
 Slot position refuses to pass silently when they disagree by more than 4%.
